{"task_id": "HumanEval/39", "solution": "def prime_fib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    prime_fib returns n-th number that is a Fibonacci number and it's also prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    def is_prime(num: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if a given integer is a prime number.\"\"\"\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        if num == 2:\n            return True\n        if num % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        i = 3\n        while i * i <= num:\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 2\n        return True\n\n    def generate_fibonacci_sequence():\n        \"\"\"Generates an infinite sequence of Fibonacci numbers (0, 1, 1, 2, ...).\"\"\"\n        a, b = 0, 1\n        while True:\n            yield a\n            a, b = b, a + b\n\n    prime_fib_count = 0\n    fib_generator = generate_fibonacci_sequence()\n\n    current_fib = next(fib_generator)\n    while True:\n        if is_prime(current_fib):\n            prime_fib_count += 1\n            if prime_fib_count == n:\n                return current_fib\n        current_fib = next(fib_generator)"}
