{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates 2^n modulo p using binary exponentiation.\n    Assumes n is non-negative and p is positive.\"\"\"\n    res = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n    exp = n\n    mod = p\n\n    while exp > 0:\n        if exp % 2 == 1:\n            res = (res * base) % mod\n        base = (base * base) % mod\n        exp //= 2\n    return res"}
