{"task_id": "HumanEval/65", "solution": "def circular_shift(x: int, shift: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Circular shifts the digits of integer x to the right.\n    If shift exceeds the number of digits, the digits are reversed.\n    \"\"\"\n    s = str(x)\n    n = len(s)\n\n    if shift > n:\n        return s[::-1]\n    else:\n        effective_shift = shift % n\n        return s[-effective_shift:] + s[:-effective_shift]"}
